    /// <p>QOffscreenSurface is intended to be used with <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qopenglcontext.html" translate="no">QOpenGLContext</a> to allow rendering with OpenGL in an arbitrary thread without the need to create a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qwindow.html" translate="no">QWindow</a>.</p>
